# Copy to `fly.secrets` (gitignored) and fill in real values from the
# WordPress.com OAuth apps (https://developer.wordpress.com/apps/).
#
# Pushed to Fly with `fly secrets import < fly.secrets` (see the Makefile).
# These are the only true secrets; non-secret config lives in fly.toml [env].
# Identity app (phase 1):
WPCOM_CLIENT_ID=
WPCOM_CLIENT_SECRET=
# a8c.tv app (phase 2) — MUST be a SEPARATE app from the identity one:
WPCOM_A8C_CLIENT_ID=
WPCOM_A8C_CLIENT_SECRET=
